  `A*DefaultKSat+B>0` always holds — old and new accept criteria are identical for every
  reachable input. Noted in the status file in case a reviewer wants to double-check this
  reasoning.
- No cross-package collector→sanity end-to-end test was added for I-6; used the plan's own
  stated fallback ("collector-level test suffices") to avoid a throughput-package test
